# Prose style

- Never use em dashes (—) or en dashes (–). Prefer commas, periods, colons, or rephrasing.
- Avoid AI-typical short punchy sentence stacks. Prefer natural rhythm with varied sentence length.
- Keep flavour understated; do not over-embellish.
